// A provider's "before/after" status — Instagram/WhatsApp-Status-style: a row
// of circular rings under the search bar on the customer home feed, gone 24
// hours after posting.
// The 24h window is enforced by filtering on `createdAt` at read time (this
// project's cron infra is once-daily at finest, too coarse for a real-time
// expiry); a daily cron additionally hard-deletes rows past that window so
// they don't accumulate indefinitely. STORY_LIFETIME_MS in
// lib/actions/provider-stories.ts is the single source of that number.
